[8990]={["aftermath"]="The amulet was reassembled, but Bodley still needed to attune the brazier before Valthalak himself could be called.",["atomIDs"]={"8990:description:1-209","8990:description:211-363","8990:description:368-400","8990:description:402-511","8990:objective:1-80","8990:objective:82-197"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"8990:completion:1-52","8990:completion:54-104","8990:completion:106-150","8990:completion:152-198","8990:completion:203-354"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Summon Isalien in Dire Maul and recover her amulet fragment.",["opening"]="Isalien sought personal answers and the stolen amulet's secrets in the ancestral city now called Dire Maul. Bodley reported that Alzzin's forces ambushed her at Eldretharr's shrine, leaving her spirit to be summoned for the fragment.",["pending"]="{actor} would summon Isalien and recover her fragment.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought Isalien's fragment and the brazier back to Bodley.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="d8981bc60fa6432c4a4db8468968fc1a5a5ceee241919a89a5a4f201033aef44",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[8991]={["aftermath"]="Bodley acknowledged the siblings' release and the amulet's reassembly, but the brazier still needed preparation before it could call Valthalak himself.",["atomIDs"]={"8991:description:1-114","8991:description:116-178","8991:description:180-229","8991:description:234-396","8991:description:401-418","8991:description:420-493","8991:objective:1-77","8991:objective:79-194"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"8991:completion:1-136","8991:completion:138-212","8991:completion:214-260","8991:completion:265-416"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Summon Jarien and Sothos, recover the amulet fragment and return to Bodley.",["opening"]="Jarien and Sothos left the mercenary company with a piece of Valthalak's amulet and tried to join the Scarlet Crusade. Bodley's reports said Dathrohan killed them during initiation; recovering the fragment now required calling their spirits into the Scarlet Bastion.",["pending"]="{actor} would use the brazier to summon the siblings and recover the fragment.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned the reassembled amulet and brazier to Bodley after facing the siblings.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="dc33b8b7d73ba75abaac275d1e546c431d340d49edffd6b4f24c86d59f0b1699",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[8992]={["aftermath"]="Bodley hoped Kormok could rest, but warned that the hardest trial still required preparing the brazier for Valthalak himself.",["atomIDs"]={"8992:description:1-90","8992:description:95-160","8992:description:162-229","8992:description:231-333","8992:description:338-426","8992:description:428-488","8992:objective:1-79","8992:objective:81-196"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"8992:completion:1-14","8992:completion:16-138","8992:completion:140-176","8992:completion:178-224","8992:completion:229-380"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Summon Kormok and return the reassembled amulet to Bodley.",["opening"]="Kormok's turn to necromancy had frightened his companions before he departed for Scholomance. Spectral assassins killed him even before Ras Frostwhisper, leaving his fragment bound to a spirit that could now be called back.",["pending"]="{actor} would summon Kormok and reclaim the last fragment.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned the reassembled amulet and brazier to Bodley.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="71f545ee651cc2a0e8e14cdebae06275148eff051f34ece2c8b3cade9c04ab73",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[8994]={["aftermath"]="Bodley prepared the final imbuement and urged persistence now that Valthalak could be called.",["atomIDs"]={"8994:description:1-23","8994:description:25-156","8994:description:161-248","8994:description:250-380","8994:description:382-469","8994:description:474-487","8994:objective:1-65","8994:objective:67-114"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"8994:completion:1-15","8994:completion:17-106","8994:completion:108-207","8994:completion:212-287"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Bring Bodley forty Blackrock bracers and a flask of supreme power.",["opening"]="The reunited amulet still needed to be returned to Valthalak. Bodley's final attunement required trace metals extracted from the orcs' bracers and a powerful flask to finish preparing the brazier for its original owner's summons.",["pending"]="{actor} would gather the last attunement materials.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} supplied Bodley with the bracers and flask.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="126e0821f520647769d92aa308b8b450f373c09d1f6ce30239e3ba40df8c1c3f",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[8995]={["aftermath"]="Valthalak recognized that the messenger was not one of the original thieves and demanded the return of what was his.",["atomIDs"]={"8995:description:1-21","8995:description:26-100","8995:description:102-174","8995:description:176-235","8995:description:237-356","8995:description:361-423","8995:description:425-494","8995:description:499-508","8995:objective:1-54","8995:objective:56-115","8995:objective:117-185"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"8995:completion:1-96","8995:completion:101-140","8995:completion:142-163"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Summon and defeat Valthalak, then restore his amulet to his spirit.",["opening"]="Valthalak had once occupied the chamber now held by the Beast. Bodley directed the summons there, warning that the reincorporated lord had to be defeated before the amulet could reunite his divided spirit.",["pending"]="{actor} would call Valthalak and return the stolen spirit amulet.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} defeated Valthalak's summoned form and restored his amulet.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="606f082dd051d3c0263c0f6caa6ae8134bec793b4d2b8f47779f65621a7b2e50",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[8996]={["aftermath"]="Bodley rejoiced that the spectral hunters would be called off, while recognizing the warning of possible future harm. He regarded the deed as partial absolution rather than the erasure of every old wrong.",["atomIDs"]={"8996:description:1-135","8996:description:137-264","8996:description:269-337","8996:description:339-381","8996:description:383-390","8996:objective:1-81"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"8996:completion:1-27","8996:completion:29-188","8996:completion:193-216","8996:completion:218-318","8996:completion:323-332","8996:completion:334-386","8996:completion:388-501"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Return the brazier to Bodley with Valthalak's response.",["opening"]="Valthalak acknowledged the return of his stolen spirit and offered the thieves temporary safety. His threat to reconsider that mercy sent the messenger back to Bodley without lingering.",["pending"]="{actor} would take Valthalak's answer and the brazier to Bodley.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned the brazier and reported Valthalak's response.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="52e7950c144b54e5205be6e7f9cb71377726f64b166785c3356efc1e76c6f625",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[8997]={["aftermath"]="Deliana welcomed the return and asked for a full account of what had happened. Arrival closed the travel leg before the final exchange of armor.",["atomIDs"]={"8997:description:1-47","8997:description:49-133","8997:description:135-240","8997:description:245-270","8997:description:272-332","8997:objective:1-49"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"8997:completion:1-51","8997:completion:53-99","8997:completion:104-144"},["opening"]="Bodley's farewell sent the account back to its beginning in Ironforge. He remained available for conversation near Blackrock, while Deliana at the High Seat needed to hear what had happened.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to report back to Deliana.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} spoke with Deliana at the High Seat.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="5a286a9eea96fd276f0780fd2445acc71135950b64fed46fc23426e9c64a43ef",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8998]={["aftermath"]="Mokvar welcomed the survivor and invited a full account of the events.",["atomIDs"]={"8998:description:1-47","8998:description:49-133","8998:description:135-240","8998:description:245-270","8998:description:272-331","8998:objective:1-67"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"8998:completion:1-47","8998:completion:49-90","8998:completion:95-135"},["opening"]="Bodley said farewell and sent news back to Mokvar. The account was to reach Grommash Hold in Orgrimmar's Valley of Wisdom.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to return to Mokvar and recount what had happened.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned to Mokvar at Grommash Hold with Bodley's news.",["sourceHash"]="171d2a30471d3e17cc96c55e83ee38c132a20ba8e7471f67f192f75170bfb591",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8999]={["atomIDs"]={"8999:description:1-28","8999:description:30-102","8999:description:104-164","8999:description:169-242","8999:objective:1-52"},["opening"]="Deliana received the account with gratitude and hope of safer sleep. The final reward exchange called for the Wildheart cowl and vest, closing the equipment bargain attached to the long assistance.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to give Deliana the Wildheart Cowl and Wildheart Vest.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the Wildheart Cowl and Wildheart Vest to Deliana.",["sourceClassMask"]="1024",["sourceHash"]="813dc48ce836919adde0467fc278a8e92d52319609c9771a33672632775c3005",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[9000]={["atomIDs"]={"9000:description:1-28","9000:description:30-102","9000:description:104-164","9000:description:169-242","9000:objective:1-62"},["opening"]="The story had given Deliana reason to hope she could sleep without fear. She offered the last promised replacements in return for the Beaststalker cap and tunic.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to bring Beaststalker's Cap and Tunic to Deliana.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed Deliana's Beaststalker cap-and-tunic exchange.",["sourceClassMask"]="4",["sourceHash"]="d7618d0e761174ea63e6a1fada301835df1ea0c3eac0ad77b65bf5620a809b88",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[9001]={["atomIDs"]={"9001:description:1-28","9001:description:30-102","9001:description:104-164","9001:description:169-242","9001:objective:1-56"},["opening"]="Deliana's thanks extended to everyone involved in the undertaking. With its account told, the Magister crown and robes were the pieces named for the concluding reward.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to deliver the Magister's Crown and Magister's Robes.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} supplied Deliana with the Magister's Crown and Magister's Robes.",["sourceClassMask"]="128",["sourceHash"]="f58db04928607c0ff7250e865d0aa6a496eb0a9709bfc58a347ab28f45a13e38",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[9002]={["atomIDs"]={"9002:description:1-28","9002:description:30-102","9002:description:104-164","9002:description:169-242","9002:objective:1-61"},["opening"]="The prospect of peaceful sleep made Deliana's gratitude more than formality. The Lightforge helm and breastplate were the final armor she asked returned in the completed bargain.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to bring the Lightforge Helm and Lightforge Breastplate.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the Lightforge Helm and Lightforge Breastplate to Deliana.",["sourceClassMask"]="2",["sourceHash"]="b9cbb6b9297be239d01ae074bb3931c6ba42a2e988f54afa52f537b1f7ae605c",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[9003]={["atomIDs"]={"9003:description:1-28","9003:description:30-102","9003:description:104-164","9003:description:169-242","9003:objective:1-47"},["opening"]="Deliana called the account amazing and thanked the people whose danger it concerned. Her remaining offer concerned the Devout crown and robe.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to give Deliana the Devout Crown and Devout Robe.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the Devout crown-and-robe turn-in to Deliana.",["sourceClassMask"]="16",["sourceHash"]="963e1d25fc1e4f95a2c903051cd48498a0c9304e8c1c4ad32d75b14466cf987e",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[9004]={["atomIDs"]={"9004:description:1-28","9004:description:30-102","9004:description:104-164","9004:description:169-242","9004:objective:1-56"},["opening"]="The long assistance returned to Deliana's promise of superior armor. Her relief at the account accompanied the last request for a Shadowcraft cap and tunic.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to take the Shadowcraft Cap and Shadowcraft Tunic to Deliana.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the Shadowcraft Cap and Shadowcraft Tunic to Deliana.",["sourceClassMask"]="8",["sourceHash"]="ffdb8bf751e120419a26adc26e0e832f39be6511d24fcc21ff67f7758e10da97",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[9005]={["atomIDs"]={"9005:description:1-28","9005:description:30-102","9005:description:104-164","9005:description:169-242","9005:objective:1-52"},["opening"]="Deliana hoped the events described would let her close both eyes at night. The final Dreadmist exchange required mask and robe before her reward could be settled.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to bring the Dreadmist Mask and Dreadmist Robe.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed Deliana's Dreadmist mask-and-robe turn-in.",["sourceClassMask"]="256",["sourceHash"]="2f265aa5d86ce5c9efd5fe730ea25df25828f5363f921c4d524a23f529dd1638",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[9006]={["atomIDs"]={"9006:description:1-28","9006:description:30-102","9006:description:104-164","9006:description:169-242","9006:objective:1-57"},["opening"]="Deliana's final gratitude reached those involved beyond the person before her. The helm and breastplate of Valor remained as the equipment due in the last exchange.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to deliver the Helm of Valor and Breastplate of Valor.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the Helm of Valor and Breastplate of Valor to Deliana.",["sourceClassMask"]="1",["sourceHash"]="7fe08573d16e078f4552bd8b5fcc48d1f1820458d46523d2a88707316d333be0",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[9007]={["aftermath"]="Mokvar acknowledged a debt he feared he could never repay and offered his wishes for the protection of the new armor.",["atomIDs"]={"9007:description:1-26","9007:description:28-118","9007:description:120-187","9007:description:192-293","9007:objective:1-51"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"9007:completion:1-26","9007:completion:28-94","9007:completion:99-134","9007:completion:136-222"},["opening"]="Mokvar said the efforts against the consequences of his past had delivered those involved from their old mistakes. He was ready to complete the armor arrangement with a Wildheart Cowl and Vest.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to give Mokvar the Wildheart Cowl and Vest.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} handed the Wildheart Cowl and Vest to Mokvar.",["sharedMechanism"]="Class-specific armor alternatives preserve the same sourced exchange; each branch requires its own listed armor.",["sourceHash"]="a8e4c8cabd00e8d871a0616d18892cf67112911a16959f0d1b7357b2062bb7e9",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[9008]={["aftermath"]="Mokvar spoke of an enduring debt and hoped the new armor would protect its bearer for years to come.",["atomIDs"]={"9008:description:1-26","9008:description:28-118","9008:description:120-187","9008:description:192-293","9008:objective:1-61"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"9008:completion:1-26","9008:completion:28-94","9008:completion:99-134","9008:completion:136-222"},["opening"]="The account of what had happened brought Mokvar to the final exchange. His gratitude accompanied an offer for a Beaststalker's Cap and Tunic.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to bring Mokvar the Beaststalker's Cap and Tunic.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} provided the Beaststalker's Cap and Tunic to Mokvar.",["sharedMechanism"]="Class-specific armor alternatives preserve the same sourced exchange; each branch requires its own listed armor.",["sourceHash"]="e6617a0797fad05a30273450e2b4184f078b927b51ef441fa66e515aaabf4bf5",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[9009]={["aftermath"]="The parting exchange left Mokvar expressing gratitude he believed might outlast his ability to repay it.",["atomIDs"]={"9009:description:1-26","9009:description:28-118","9009:description:120-187","9009:description:192-293","9009:objective:1-46"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"9009:completion:1-26","9009:completion:28-94","9009:completion:99-134","9009:completion:136-222"},["opening"]="Mokvar credited the help he had received with freeing those involved from the mistakes of their past. A Devout Crown and Robe were the remaining pieces for his exchange.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to present the Devout Crown and Robe.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} gave Mokvar the Devout Crown and Robe.",["sharedMechanism"]="Class-specific armor alternatives preserve the same sourced exchange; each branch requires its own listed armor.",["sourceHash"]="6da3d0c991e402cd69aa28da9bc925ddd67fa08db46ac104a7ddada463f43745",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[9010]={["aftermath"]="Mokvar wished the new armor long service and admitted that the debt between them might never be repaid.",["atomIDs"]={"9010:description:1-26","9010:description:28-118","9010:description:120-187","9010:description:192-293","9010:objective:1-55"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"9010:completion:1-26","9010:completion:28-94","9010:completion:99-134","9010:completion:136-222"},["opening"]="Mokvar's thanks now extended to everyone involved in the affair. With the old mistakes answered, he offered the last trade for a Shadowcraft Cap and Tunic.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to offer the Shadowcraft Cap and Tunic to Mokvar.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} handed Mokvar the Shadowcraft Cap and Tunic.",["sharedMechanism"]="Class-specific armor alternatives preserve the same sourced exchange; each branch requires its own listed armor.",["sourceHash"]="4904c264cc35d31433ad5d3bd394ca25d2280299a44bb97e560fd1de9718b1b4",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[9011]={["aftermath"]="Mokvar's farewell carried both gratitude and the hope that the new armor would guard its bearer through further service.",["atomIDs"]={"9011:description:1-26","9011:description:28-118","9011:description:120-187","9011:description:192-293","9011:objective:1-55"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"9011:completion:1-26","9011:completion:28-94","9011:completion:99-134","9011:completion:136-222"},["opening"]="The final part of Mokvar's agreement concerned a Coif and Vest of Elements. He credited the work behind it with delivering those involved from the consequences of their past.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to supply the Coif of Elements and Vest of Elements.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} gave Mokvar the coif and vest for the final exchange.",["sharedMechanism"]="Class-specific armor alternatives preserve the same sourced exchange; each branch requires its own listed armor.",["sourceHash"]="bc8303eb1cbd95c8bbf4704b8206f0b7e3cffc69d3d33328f6afe10af3666a61",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[9012]={["aftermath"]="Mokvar acknowledged an obligation he might never fully repay and wished his departing helper lasting protection.",["atomIDs"]={"9012:description:1-26","9012:description:28-118","9012:description:120-187","9012:description:192-293","9012:objective:1-51"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"9012:completion:1-26","9012:completion:28-94","9012:completion:99-134","9012:completion:136-222"},["opening"]="Mokvar was ready to settle the last part of his armor bargain. In thanks for help that had answered the mistakes of his past, he would accept a Dreadmist Mask and Robe.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to take the Dreadmist Mask and Robe to Mokvar.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the Dreadmist Mask and Robe to Mokvar.",["sharedMechanism"]="Class-specific armor alternatives preserve the same sourced exchange; each branch requires its own listed armor.",["sourceHash"]="78c0dbb7ed68b23376c319068693208b6d811466a7a36654f9133a5cd846c6f2",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[9013]={["aftermath"]="Mokvar's farewell recognized a lasting debt and expressed hope that the new armor would serve well.",["atomIDs"]={"9013:description:1-26","9013:description:28-118","9013:description:120-187","9013:description:192-293","9013:objective:1-56"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"9013:completion:1-26","9013:completion:28-94","9013:completion:99-134","9013:completion:136-222"},["opening"]="A Helm and Breastplate of Valor stood between Mokvar and his final exchange. He offered the trade with thanks for the work that had delivered those involved from old mistakes.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to present the Helm of Valor and Breastplate of Valor.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought Mokvar the helm and breastplate.",["sharedMechanism"]="Class-specific armor alternatives preserve the same sourced exchange; each branch requires its own listed armor.",["sourceHash"]="fb6ffb69412c10be871f8157a3cfd4b799be192cee63e6a6c8b5402d4faa1db6",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
